00:23:45.600 --> 00:23:50.000
and every week we would have artsy wednesday&nbsp;
where we would have a different nail art theme&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:53.520
and i think these sorts of techniques&nbsp;
still work in the age of social media&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:53.520 --> 00:23:58.640
just having lots of support and working on nice&nbsp;
collaborative projects i also just felt like the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:58.640 --> 00:24:03.280
content i was making just needed to be made no&nbsp;
one else was making this sort of thing back in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:03.280 --> 00:24:07.920
the day so things like scientific deep dives and&nbsp;
myth busting in a way that's accurate but also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:07.920 --> 00:24:12.880
people could really understand but on the other&nbsp;
