00:24:46.960 --> 00:24:51.680
what makes you happiest about doing youtube&nbsp;
and lab muffin i'm just a bit of a massive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:51.680 --> 00:24:55.600
nerd i love understanding stuff at a&nbsp;
really deep level and then explaining&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:55.600 --> 00:24:59.440
it to other people i also really love&nbsp;
